  "metadata": {
    "title": "Fusion 360 CAM Post-Processor + NC Output Surface — Complete Enumeration",
    "description": "Comprehensive parameter catalog for the Fusion 360 post-processor (post.cps) grammar surface and NC output pipeline: kernel definition, number-format / output rules, controller-dialect variant selection (Fanuc 0i/30i, Mazak Smooth-G, Okuma OSP-P300, Heidenhain TNC 640, Siemens 840D, Haas NGC), section headers (tool change, WCS, comments), linear / rapid / 5-axis motion, circular / helical motion (I-J-K vs R), canned cycles (G73/G81/G82/G83/G84/G85/G86/G87/G89), modal commands (spindle, coolant, dwell, probe), pre-emit safety validation, and file-delivery + simulation hooks. Closes the bottom of the Fusion 360 CAM stack — every toolpath catalogued in MS0/MS1-01..10 ultimately funnels through this surface to produce shop-ready NC code.",
    "version": "2026.04",
    "extractedDate": "2026-04-30",
    "milestone": "CAM-EXHAUST-MS1-11",
    "source": "Autodesk Fusion 360 Manual NC Reference + post.cps Post Processor SDK + Autodesk HSM Post Library (FANUC.cps, MAZAK.cps, OKUMA.cps, HEIDENHAIN.cps, SINUMERIK.cps, HAAS_NEXT_GEN.cps) + ISO 6983-1 (G-code basics) + ISO 14649 (STEP-NC) + Fanuc 30i/31i/0i Operators Manual + Mazak Smooth-G Programming Manual + Okuma OSP-P300 Programming Manual + Heidenhain TNC 640 User Manual + Siemens 840D sl Operating Manual + Haas Mill / Lathe Operators Manual",
