    "POST_NC_VALIDATION": {
      "description": "Pre-emit safety / sanity validation — bounds-check every block before write. Catches: rapid above feed-rate cap, feed below minimum, spindle outside [min, max] of selected machine, axis travel beyond work envelope, coolant requested without machine support, TCP mode on machine without RTCP, cycle on plane mismatch, missing modal preconditions. Hard-fails the post if a block violates safety thresholds.",
